# The NAMES of the keys that the scripts in scripts/ need. Never put real values in this file.
#
# How to use it: make a copy of this file called .env (it never leaves your computer),
# then fill in the values there. Ask an admin where to get each key.
#
# create-skill adds a line here whenever a new script needs a key, for example:
# EXAMPLE_APP_API_KEY=
